# NTN/ns-3.43 adaptation patch - TS 38.331 5.5.4.1 periodical measurement reports in NrUeRrc; opt-in TS 38.215 5.1.3 RSRQ and 5.1.1 linear RSRP averaging in NrUePhy (GlobalValues NrUeRsrqFromRssi, NrUeRsrpLinearAverage)
# base: upstream 5g-lena v3.3.1 plus patches 01-07
# apply from contrib/nr/ with: patch -p1 < ntn-patches/08-nr-ue-periodical-meas-report-rsrq.patch
#
diff --git a/model/nr-ue-phy.cc b/model/nr-ue-phy.cc
